        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Liability under the Child Support Act 1991 to pay child support maintenance to any person is not a debt or liability for the purposes of Part 8"
        IF `the liability is a liability under the Child Support Act 1991 to pay child support maintenance to a person` THEN JUST FALSE
